## Scope of this license

The MIT license above covers original code in this repository authored for
the Quality-Aware Longitudinal Lung CT Follow-up Assistant project
(`src/quality_aware_lung_ct/{data,preprocessing,training,evaluation,common}`,
`scripts/`, `tests/`, `docs/`, and this packaging).

**It does not cover, and does not attempt to license, the reimplemented
NGP-Net architecture** (`src/quality_aware_lung_ct/ngpnet/`). That code is
migrated from the official author implementation at
<https://github.com/XinKai-Tang/NGP-Net> (Tang, Luo, Liu, Huang & Zou,
IEEE TMI 2026). As of this writing that upstream repository publishes no
LICENSE file (`license: null` via the GitHub API) and its README states no
usage terms. **License status for the NGP-Net code requires clarification
directly with the original authors before any redistribution** beyond the
research/educational use this repository is built for. Do not assume MIT
terms apply to `ngpnet/`; the MIT header above is not a substitute for
that clarification.

**It does not cover the PNG dataset**, which is never committed to this
repository (see `data/README.md`) and is redistributed by its authors
under the terms described at its Kaggle source
(see `docs/upstream/NGP-Net-README.md`), not under this license.
